{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防處在黃大仙商場停車場搗破流動非法加油站，檢獲逾300公升汽油。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防處周二在黃大仙鳳德商場停車場發現這輛載有油缸的客貨車，檢獲的汽油市值約10,500元。行動拘捕一名男子，將被控違反《消防規例》及《危險品條例》等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.OIL-1100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026VT8EZEKc8n1787109226.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.OIL-1100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防重申非法加油站沒有消防裝置及設備，一旦發生火警後果非常嚴重。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T03:20:41.288005+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}